    "preamble": "M/S.Jeyyam Global Foods Pvt. Ltd vs The Commissioner Food Safety on 3 April, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.17565 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 03.04.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.17565, 17571, 21498, 21501, 21504, 21507, 21508, 21511, 215 21514, 21516, 21518, 22599, 22602, 22633, 22978, 22989, 23006, 230 23018, 23053, 23813, 19555, 19579, 19583, 19585, 19595, 19596, 246 and 24620 to 24623 of 2022 and W.M.P. Nos.16840, 16846, 20513, 20517, 20520, 20523, 20525, 20530 20532, 20534, 20536, 20539, 21648, 21649, 21657, 21659, 21690, 219 21986, 22006, 22030, 22037, 22060, 22068, 22797, 18850, 18870, 188 18880, 18889, 18893, 23585, 23586, 23587, 23589 and 23590 of 202 W.P.No.17565 of 2022 M/s.Jeyyam Global Foods Pvt. Ltd., Represented by its Authorized Signatory, S.Sathish, Having their Registered Office at #37, Padmavathiyar Street, Gopalapuram, Chennai 600 086. Vs 1. The Commissioner Food Safety, Office of the Commissioner of Food Safety, 5th Floor of Dms Office Building, 259, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Theynampet, Chennai 600 006. (R1 cause title amended vide order dated 12.01.2023 made in W.M.P.No.20466 of 2022 in W.P.No.17565 of 2022) 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.17 M/S.Jeyyam Global Foods Pvt. Ltd vs The Commissioner Food Safety on 3 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/137204225/ 1 2. The Additional District Magistrate/Revenue Divisional Officer, Villupuram District, Villupuram Collectorate, Villupuram - 605 602. 3. The Designated Officer, Villupuram District, Tamil Nadu Food Safety & Drug Administration Department, Room No.38, 2nd Floor, Office of the District Collector, Villupuram 605 602. 4. The Food Analyst, Food Analysis Laboratory , No.219, Race Course Road, Coimbatore 18. . Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Consti praying to issue a Writ of Certiorari, calling for the records of t respondent pertaining to the impugned order dated 05.05.2022 passed Na.Ka.No.A2/01/2021 and quash the same as prima facie illegal, impr not in accordance with law and against the principles of natural ju hence a nullity. For Petitioner in all W.Ps : Mr.E.Vigneshwar for Mr. Velayutham Pi For R-1 in all : Mr.Su.Srinivasan W.P.s 2/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.175 For R-2 to R-4 in W.P. : Mr.P.Kumaresan, Nos.17565, 17571, 22599 Additional Advocate Gene and 22602 of 2022 & assisted by Mr.K.Tippu S for R-2 & R3 in W.P. Government Advocate Nos. 21498, 21501, 21504, 21507, 21508, 21511, 21513, 21514, 21516, 21518, 22633, 22978, 22989, 23006, 23011, 23018, 23053, 23813, 19555, 19579, 19583, 19585, 19595, 19596, 24611 and 24620 to 24623 of 2022 COMMON ORDER M/S.Jeyyam Global Foods Pvt. Ltd vs The Commissioner Food Safety on 3 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/137204225/ 2 These Writ Petitions have been filed against the various impugned orders and notices.",
